This module downloads, at run time, the th08-web build v0.1.0
(https://github.com/N0zoM1z0/th08-web, MIT License) onto the TV. It does not
redistribute that build, and it never contains or downloads Touhou game data:
th08.dat and thbgm.dat come only from the user's own legal copy.
